[agent:result]                                   ISO timestamp for the last trigger.
[agent:result]   --start-offset-seconds INTEGER  Per-fire offset for HOPS_START_TIME (data
[agent:result]                                   window start). Negative looks back from the
[agent:result]                                   cron fire (e.g. -3600 = window starts 1h
[agent:result]                                   before fire). Default (omitted) = previous
